{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u7ewgEWAZA1794469980.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國泰航空有兩架波音777客機，分別因為技術原因和懷疑撞到雀鳥，需要轉飛其他機場或折返。</p><p></p><p>國泰航空回覆查詢指，昨日由東京成田機場返港的CX521航班，因技術原因，要中途轉飛大阪關西國際機場，並安排乘客轉乘另一航班返港。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"J.CATHAY-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263oFrsH9twc1794478394.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>而周二由倫敦希斯羅機場返港編號CX252的航班，亦按既定程序返回希斯羅機場。據了解，航班懷疑撞到雀鳥。國泰指已安排乘客轉乘其他航班返港，而工程團隊會仔細檢查及維修涉事飛機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:07.263299+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T00:17:39.213779+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:29.143116+00:00","content_hash":"f8c64ab9720cb480533bcab1d54da070234fc8d9b2b1dc243984703c388c8ae7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:07.263299+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}